\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {\small 15\normalsize }{\ignorespaces Usable pose yield per frame-ligand unit. Each point is one Orai frame paired with one ligand}}{60}{figure.caption.24}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {\small 16\normalsize }{\ignorespaces Transmembrane loss of PoseBusters-valid poses, benchmark against experimental ligands. Panel (A) loss rate per tool as pooled pose-level proportions with Wilson 95\% intervals. Panel (B) the difference per tool as benchmark minus experimental, in percentage points}}{62}{figure.caption.25}%
