\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {\small 18\normalsize }{\ignorespaces Cross-tool agreement on Orai. Panel (A) gives the inter-tool consensus-site distance per tool pair, hatched for the experimental ligands and solid for the benchmark set, and its fourth position summarises all pairs as the mean per pair. Panel (B) gives the percentage of pairs within the 5\ensuremath {\text {\r A}}{} threshold per tool pair, with Wilson 95\% intervals and the underlying counts, and its fourth position pools every pair into one rate rather than averaging the three per-pair rates}}{65}{figure.caption.27}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {\small 19\normalsize }{\ignorespaces Reference-free cluster quality per tool on Orai, the experimental ligands against the benchmark control panel on the raw pose cloud. Panel (A) silhouette, panel (B) Calinski-Harabasz index, panel (C) Davies-Bouldin index, panel (D) compactness, panel (E) separation and panel (F) bootstrap stability. Panel (B) is truncated on the vertical axis, with 148 outliers off-scale up to a maximum of 2,209,006}}{67}{figure.caption.28}%
